# Google Maps API Key
# Ganti dengan API key Anda. Jangan commit file .env ke repository!
# Dapatkan API key di: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Cara menjalankan:
# flutter run --dart-define=GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# flutter build apk --dart-define=GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# flutter build ios --dart-define=GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...